8. YOUR DATA
Word Cue processes audio on the Mac it runs on and does not record or send
audio anywhere. Anything you choose to send (feedback, diagnostic reports,
corrections) is sent only when you choose to send it.

9. NO WARRANTY
Word Cue is provided "as is," without warranty of any kind. Speech
recognition and scripture detection can be wrong. Word Cue waits for an
operator to approve each verse by default; a church that turns on
Auto-send accepts that a wrong verse may reach the screen.

